    "transcript": "Test 3 Part 1. Planning a surprise party. 80 people; 26 September; King Room; jazz; table service; lemon cake; congratulations; card 5544120043268887; Brian Sebastian Troy; extra charge for service.",
    "formContent": "<div class=\"ielts-form-container\"><div class=\"form-section\"><div class=\"form-title\" style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:700;\">Planning a party</div><p><em>Example</em><br>Reason for event: wife&rsquo;s <u><em>promotion</em></u></p><p><strong>EVENT DETAILS</strong></p><ul style=\"line-height:2;\"><li>Event option: large surprise party</li><li>Number of people: <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"1\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"></li><li>Date: <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"2\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"></li><li>Day of week: Friday</li><li>Time: 6 &ndash; 10 p.m.</li><li>Location: the <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"3\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"> Room</li><li>Type of music <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"4\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"></li></ul><p><strong>FOOD</strong></p><ul style=\"line-height:2;\"><li>Service option <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"5\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"></li><li>Flavour of cake: <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"6\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"></li><li>Message on cake: <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"7\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"></li></ul><p><strong>PAYMENT</strong></p><ul style=\"line-height:2;\"><li>Reservation fee paid: $100</li><li>Credit card type: Mastercard</li><li>Credit card number: <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"8\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"></li><li>Name: Brian <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"9\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"> Troy</li><li>Additional fees: ex